<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila Central Bank offers 91- and 364-day bills.</title>
<headline>Manila Central Bank offers 91- and 364-day bills.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Central Bank on Wednesday started offering 91-day special series Treasury bills at 10.0 percent and 364-day bills at 10.70 percent.</p>
<p>It stopped selling 43-day special series T-bills which had a rate of 10.0 percent.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
